My tack would be this:

Start by wishing for the MKoT, +2 SDSM, and speed boots.  Make a dash
for mine's end by digging with a pick-axe and get the luckstone, then
try to get teleportitis on the way up.  In minetown, buy candles, and
if the altar is coaligned, sacrifice up to max luck.  Work your way
back up through the mines and then down through the dungeon until you
get teleportitis and max luck, then teleport to the castle and storm
it.  Wish for a magic marker and write a cursed scroll of genocide or
two and reverse genocide wraiths to get up to level 14.  Do the quest,
wish up the remainder of your kit, and proceed to Gehennom.

